    "message": "chore(ci): drop the temporary run-reporting job from main\n\nThe job existed only to make the real ci.yml run on main observable: the run is\nread-only by design (permissions: contents: read, persist-credentials: false, no\nwrite-back) and the repo is private, so it left no git-visible trace. The report\nis in (run 35310705441 on 246fa66, and the untampered run 35310138889 on\ndc0602e, both completed/success with 107/0/2 workspace tests and 16/0 e2e), so\nmain goes back to carrying no recon infrastructure.\n\nci.yml is restored byte-for-byte to dc0602e: `git diff dc0602e HEAD` is empty.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
